[0.462, "o", "Command: grep -r pattern .\r\n         ^^^^\r\n         \u2514\u2500\u2500 Matched: rune.search:grep-use-rg\r\n\r\nPack: rune.search\r\nPattern: grep-use-rg\r\nReason: Use rg (ripgrep) instead of grep.\r\nExplanation: rg is faster, respects .gitignore, and prints file and line by\r\n  default. Replace grep -r pattern . with rg pattern.\r\n  git grep stays allowed.\r\nSource: pack\r\n[dcg] Interactive mode not available: interactive mode is disabled in configuration\r\nResult: BLOCKED\r\n"]
